{
  "work": "Changsha Ferris Wheel by He Long Stadium has a separately ticketed rooftop entrance. English, Chinese, city and stadium duplicate searches in the official editor found no matching Park or StandaloneAttraction. This wheel is distinct from the Martyrs Park wheel dismantled in October 2026 and the Window of the World wheel. Created and published a standalone record with eight original localized descriptions, two weekly hour rules, an opening milestone, and three exact Commons photos clearly labelled as historical (2007, 2017 and 2018). Published the site and Facebook post.",
